WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.156 --> 00:00:06.737
Tristay: What what is that?

2
00:00:14.759 --> 00:00:16.800
A rainbow!

3
00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:19.141
It has all the colors imaginable.

4
00:00:19.821 --> 00:00:20.841
It’s beautiful!

5
00:00:26.743 --> 00:00:27.783
Ha-ha, you fool.

6
00:00:28.523 --> 00:00:31.164
More color will only make me stronger.

7
00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:39.522
Tristay: I I feel strange.

8
00:00:40.563 --> 00:00:42.744
There is so much color.

9
00:00:44.065 --> 00:00:48.687
Tina: What’s happening?

10
00:00:48.707 --> 00:00:51.109
Brad: Look at Tristay.

11
00:00:51.749 --> 00:00:52.910
He’s acting strange!

12
00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:56.192
Danny: It’s working, it’s working!

13
00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:06.861
Tina: Something’s happening to the ground!

14
00:01:06.881 --> 00:01:10.142
Brad: Life is coming back to the mountaintop!

15
00:01:10.782 --> 00:01:23.208
Tristay: Something is happening to me Hopian: Danny, look out!

16
00:01:25.689 --> 00:01:27.369
Danny: Hopian, you’re okay!

17
00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:31.271
Hopian: Watch out, everyone.

18
00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:33.112
He’s going to explode!

19
00:01:34.984 --> 00:01:40.227
Tristay: Too much color inside I can’t hold it all in.

20
00:01:40.247 --> 00:01:44.470
Tristay: It’s all coming to an end.

21
00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:45.731
Oh no!

22
00:01:46.451 --> 00:01:58.579
Ahhhhhhh! What what just happened?

23
00:01:58.599 --> 00:02:00.500
Tina: Where’s Tristay?

24
00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:05.741
Danny: We defeated him!

25
00:02:05.761 --> 00:02:08.162
Tristay is gone, isn’t he?

26
00:02:08.182 --> 00:02:10.083
Hopian: Yes, he is!

27
00:02:10.103 --> 00:02:14.945
Danny: I told you we could do it, I told you!

28
00:02:14.965 --> 00:02:17.726
Tina: You were great, Danny!

29
00:02:18.346 --> 00:02:19.467
Your rainbow did it!

30
00:02:20.507 --> 00:02:21.127
Bello: Rainbow!

31
00:02:21.147 --> 00:02:23.408
Danny: We all did it!

32
00:02:25.829 --> 00:02:31.452
Tina: What happened to Tristay?

33
00:02:32.144 --> 00:02:35.026
Hopian: The colors of the rainbow were too much for him.

34
00:02:35.046 --> 00:02:37.187
Hopian: He couldn’t absorb them all.

35
00:02:37.207 --> 00:02:40.789
Danny: Like eating too much ice cream makes you sick?

36
00:02:40.809 --> 00:02:43.610
Hopian: Yes, something like that.

37
00:02:44.651 --> 00:02:47.292
The colors burst out and destroyed him.

38
00:02:47.312 --> 00:02:51.935
Brad: Hey, here’s the rainbow that you threw into the air.

39
00:02:51.955 --> 00:02:55.797
Danny: It didn’t stay in the air?

40
00:02:55.817 --> 00:02:58.438
Tina: It must have fallen back down.

41
00:02:58.458 --> 00:03:01.180
Hopian: Let me have a look at that, Brad.

42
00:03:03.636 --> 00:03:06.198
Hopian: You used your imagination well, Danny.

43
00:03:06.218 --> 00:03:10.021
Danny: Well, I knew that I had to make a rainbow.

44
00:03:10.041 --> 00:03:12.383
Danny: That’s how we got to Ginormous.

45
00:03:12.403 --> 00:03:15.385
Hopian: I’m not talking about that.

46
00:03:15.405 --> 00:03:19.127
Hopian: I’m talking about how you made the rainbow.

47
00:03:19.147 --> 00:03:21.809
Danny: I had some magic clay left over.

48
00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:23.230
It was easy.

49
00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:27.153
Hopian: Danny, this is not magic clay.

50
00:03:27.934 --> 00:03:30.456
This is regular clay, from your world.

51
00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:32.220
Danny: No.

52
00:03:32.601 --> 00:03:34.081
It must have been magic clay.

53
00:03:34.101 --> 00:03:37.623
Danny: If it is normal clay, how did I make the rainbow?

54
00:03:37.643 --> 00:03:41.225
Hopian: Look for yourself, Danny.

55
00:03:42.166 --> 00:03:44.407
This is just regular clay.

56
00:03:44.427 --> 00:03:47.149
Danny: That’s impossible.

57
00:03:47.169 --> 00:03:49.910
Hopian: No, Danny.

58
00:03:50.531 --> 00:03:52.692
Your imagination made it possible.

59
00:03:52.712 --> 00:03:59.736
Hopian: It was your imagination, and your imagination alone, that saved us.

60
00:04:00.732 --> 00:04:02.074
Danny: I don’t understand.

61
00:04:02.094 --> 00:04:06.220
Hopian: Imagination is a powerful thing.

62
00:04:07.281 --> 00:04:08.443
Never forget that.

63
00:04:08.463 --> 00:04:15.092
Hopian: If you use it properly, it will help solve many problems [n3@throughout your life.
